      },
      "process": {
        "label": "How to Apply",
        "questions": [
          "What are the steps to apply for Bronze certification?",
          "How do I take the ZED Pledge?",
          "What is the ZED Pledge?",
          "What is KAWACH or WASH certification?",
          "How do I login to the ZED portal?",
          "What is the assessment process for Bronze?",
          "Who does the assessment for ZED certification?",
          "How long after applying will I get the certificate?"
